.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-purge 1  "swarm 0.2.2" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-purge \- Delete a repo\*(Aqs store and manifests, and stop serving it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm purge\fR [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-delete\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPO\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a repo\*(Aqs store and manifests, and stop serving it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Do not ask for confirmation. The signing key is kept
.TP
\fB\-\-delete\-key\fR
Also delete the signing key. It cannot be recreated
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>
A repo ID or link
